  15: def main(input_grid):
  16:     """
  17:     Punch alternating black holes through the center line of each monochromatic 3-wide rectangle.
  18: 
  19:     Input structure:
  20:     - The grid contains one or more separated non-black monochromatic rectangles.
  21:     - Each rectangle has short side length 3 and an odd long side.
